== relational schema
Relational schema
Notation: _name_ primary key, /name/ foreign key, _/name/_ both

Ausbilder : {(_PersNr_ : integer)}
Lehrlinge : {(_LehrlingNr_ : integer)}
Kurse : {(_KursNr_ : integer)}
bewerten : {(_/PersNr/_ : integer, _/LehrlingNr/_ : integer, _/KursNr/_ : integer, Note : string)}

Foreign keys
  bewerten.PersNr -> Ausbilder.PersNr
  bewerten.LehrlingNr -> Lehrlinge.LehrlingNr
  bewerten.KursNr -> Kurse.KursNr

Notes
  'bewerten': all foreign keys form the key, because (min,max) cannot express that some sides determine another.
